{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>旺角發生火警。今日（26日）下午5時10分，警方及消防接獲報案，指登打士街83號有棚網起火。消防員接報趕赴現場，隨即動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊進行灌救，至下午5時18分將火救熄。</p><p>意外中，一名姓劉（55歲）男工人受傷。據了解，事主當時在外牆離地約2米高的棚架位置維修水喉，並用火槍燒焊，意外傷及自己並波及棚網，火勢迅即熄滅。劉男手部及小腿二級燒傷，清醒由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。警方經初步調查後，將案件列作「火警」及「有人意外受傷」處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。(羅日昇攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202695679739301888256409.jpeg/Tztt-CJl6_fkpPXiJP93eB6gpt7atv_QaIKgg02CoIM\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。(羅日昇攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。(羅日昇攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202695676522139648917524.jpeg/O5K-Cyhh7DfOab7ls2mNJ9RtZ2bO3QmSCoYgGC-GIBg\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。(羅日昇攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員接報趕赴現場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊進行灌救。（Threads icyboreddaily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202690386976444416642839.jpeg/xls0O6Izof97oOMXQmRoLezhnSqn2F-2pNEbLaTRGy0\"/><figcaption>消防員接報趕赴現場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊進行灌救。（Threads icyboreddaily）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員接報趕赴現場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊進行灌救。（Threads icyboreddaily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202690384577171456957683.jpeg/7vEa37V3tOKLMHS5PQqOKYsgcfbCptwyGBhJ7BgYSew\"/><figcaption>消防員接報趕赴現場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊進行灌救。（Threads icyboreddaily）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:58.697244+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:49:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:28.619720+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:29.209201+00:00","content_hash":"901014403e6eb6e25cb55b01dbd744918a58a2d6272f32d85a76863800bc7e96","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}